# Normalize line endings on commit and check out LF everywhere.
#
# This repo is edited from Windows over a /mnt/c path, and without this whole
# files kept showing up as rewritten when only their line endings had changed -
# a two-line edit would arrive as a 140-line diff and bury the real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.JPG binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
